{"type":"message","id":"f514d09a","parentId":"74c12b0f","timestamp":"2026-03-29T01:30:35.157Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_j1k0g3dih6cn_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"arXiv search by topic title abstract advanced search tips 2024\",\n  \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1968,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b344300b66eecd70\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSearching Preprint Servers – arXiv – Advanced Library ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b344300b66eecd70\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://pressbooks.openeducationalberta.ca/advancedlibsearch/chapter/searching-preprint-servers-arxiv/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b807932d7ffd5da4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n# 12 Searching Preprint Servers – arXiv. ### Searching Preprint Servers. For a comprehensive literature search, you must search other databases in addition to preprint servers to find all of the articles you need. ##### **Advanced search**. The easiest way to search by research topic is through the advanced search function:. arxiv search bar with the advanced search option highlighted. Click Advanced Search below the homepage search bar. Once you are in the advanced search, you can set your search up by adding new terms:. Image of advanced search function. * Do not use parentheses in the arXiv search bar. * The advanced search page also has a lot of great information on how to search arXiv. When you find a preprint on arXiv that you want to use in your own work, always check whether there is a published version. You can set up email alerts so that you are notified when new preprints are added to arXiv. You can customize your email alert to your subject area.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b807932d7ffd5da4\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.99893504\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0d2fda6e8ec3a09a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nArXiv Full-Text Search with Keyword Snippet Extraction\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0d2fda6e8ec3a09a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.rnfinity.com/arxiv/search\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b680897c79c0b42e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHome News View Ebooks View Articles Personality Tests Calculators Quizzes Sitemap Builder Pubmed Search ARXIV Search About Registration Help Submission Help Submit Article Submit Ebook Contact Login Register. # arXiv Two-Stage Search Assistant. Advanced semantic search across arXiv papers with Boolean logic support. 2 Search within paper content. ### Searching arXiv... Uses arXiv's advanced search syntax. Searches full LaTeX source text of papers found in Stage 1. #### Search Tips. • **Basic Search:** Finds papers by metadata only. • **Deep Search:** Two-stage search (metadata → content). • **Date Range:** Filter papers by publication date. • Press Enter in content field to start Deep Search. ### Boolean Search Assistant. Click any button to append the Boolean operator to your search query:. #### Date Search Examples. • `submittedDate:[20230101 TO 20231231]` - Year 2023. • `submittedDate:[20240101 TO *]` - From 2024 onward. • `submittedDate:[20220101 TO 20221231] AND cat:cs.AI` - 2022 AI papers. • Use date pickers above for easier date filtering.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b680897c79c0b42e\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.99893504\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2ea40bf01173f404\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\narXiv advanced search\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2ea40bf01173f404\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/search/advanced\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"099bb50ed1ffad3e\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWe gratefully acknowledge support from. the Simons Foundation, member institutions, and all contributors. # Advanced Search. You may filter on either submission date or announcement date. Note that announcement date supports only year and month granularity. #### Searching by Author Name. #### Searching by subcategory. ## Tips.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"099bb50ed1ffad3e\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.99890125\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a626e1a63cc49db6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSearch arxiv for papers with certain keywords in the Abstract\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a626e1a63cc49db6\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/homangab/arxiv-search\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9d08e16f6d30adb0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nYou signed in with another tab or window. You signed out in another tab or window. You switched accounts on another tab or window. | Name | Name | Last commit message | Last commit date |. | Latest commit   History2 Commits 2 Commits |. # Searching arxiv for papers based on topic and timestamp. This script is based on the Arxiv API and is a quick way to scrape arxiv for papers based on topics (like Model-based RL) and a timestamp beyond which to search. Run `python arxiv_by_topic.py  --time=` to obtain a csv file `arxiv.csv` of URLs for all papers with the specified keywords in the abstract and first upload timestamp beond the time specified. For example, to search for all papers with keywords `model` and `reinforcement` in the abstract with a first upload timestamp beyond Jan 1, 2019, use the following command `python arxiv_by_topic.py model reinforcement --time='2019-01-01'`. Search arxiv for papers with certain keywords in the Abstract.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9d08e16f6d30adb0\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.99877447\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0c5aba289ce01e84\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSearch for articles - arXiv info\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0c5aba289ce01e84\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://info.arxiv.org/help/find.html\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"35048414f031a007\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWe gratefully acknowledge support from the Simons Foundation, member institutions, and all contributors. + If you know the identifier. # Finding Articles. ## Search. Enter a few title words and/or author names and/or abstract words into the \\\"**Search or Article-id**\\\" box in the top right of most pages (including this one) or you can use the Advanced Search. ## If you know the identifier. All arXiv submissions are assigned a unique identifier of the form `yymm.nnnnn` (or `arch-ive/yymmnnn` for older submissions). To retrieve the abstract page a paper simply enter the identifier in the \\\"**Search or Article-id**\\\" box in the top right of most pages. You can also construct the URL (web address) for a paper with a given identifier as `http://arxiv.org/abs/`. http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9603067 http://arxiv.org/abs/0705.0123. From the abstract page you will be able to choose your preferred format for downloading and viewing the paper. Get status notifications via email or slack.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"35048414f031a007\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.9979966\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"arXiv search by topic title abstract advanced search tips 2024","provider":"tavily","count":5,"tookMs":1968,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"tavily","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b344300b66eecd70\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nSearching Preprint Servers – arXiv – Advanced Library ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b344300b66eecd70\">>>","url":"https://pressbooks.openeducationalberta.ca/advancedlibsearch/chapter/searching-preprint-servers-arxiv/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b807932d7ffd5da4\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n# 12 Searching Preprint Servers – arXiv. ### Searching Preprint Servers. For a comprehensive literature search, you must search other databases in addition to preprint servers to find all of the articles you need. ##### **Advanced search**. The easiest way to search by research topic is through the advanced search function:. arxiv search bar with the advanced search option highlighted. Click Advanced Search below the homepage search bar. Once you are in the advanced search, you can set your search up by adding new terms:. Image of advanced search function. * Do not use parentheses in the arXiv search bar. * The advanced search page also has a lot of great information on how to search arXiv. When you find a preprint on arXiv that you want to use in your own work, always check whether there is a published version. You can set up email alerts so that you are notified when new preprints are added to arXiv. You can customize your email alert to your subject area.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b807932d7ffd5da4\">>>","score":0.99893504},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0d2fda6e8ec3a09a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nArXiv Full-Text Search with Keyword Snippet Extraction\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0d2fda6e8ec3a09a\">>>","url":"https://www.rnfinity.com/arxiv/search","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b680897c79c0b42e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nHome News View Ebooks View Articles Personality Tests Calculators Quizzes Sitemap Builder Pubmed Search ARXIV Search About Registration Help Submission Help Submit Article Submit Ebook Contact Login Register. # arXiv Two-Stage Search Assistant. Advanced semantic search across arXiv papers with Boolean logic support. 2 Search within paper content. ### Searching arXiv... Uses arXiv's advanced search syntax. Searches full LaTeX source text of papers found in Stage 1. #### Search Tips. • **Basic Search:** Finds papers by metadata only. • **Deep Search:** Two-stage search (metadata → content). • **Date Range:** Filter papers by publication date. • Press Enter in content field to start Deep Search. ### Boolean Search Assistant. Click any button to append the Boolean operator to your search query:. #### Date Search Examples. • `submittedDate:[20230101 TO 20231231]` - Year 2023. • `submittedDate:[20240101 TO *]` - From 2024 onward. • `submittedDate:[20220101 TO 20221231] AND cat:cs.AI` - 2022 AI papers. • Use date pickers above for easier date filtering.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b680897c79c0b42e\">>>","score":0.99893504},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2ea40bf01173f404\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\narXiv advanced search\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2ea40bf01173f404\">>>","url":"https://arxiv.org/search/advanced","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"099bb50ed1ffad3e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWe gratefully acknowledge support from. the Simons Foundation, member institutions, and all contributors. # Advanced Search. You may filter on either submission date or announcement date. Note that announcement date supports only year and month granularity. #### Searching by Author Name. #### Searching by subcategory. ## Tips.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"099bb50ed1ffad3e\">>>","score":0.99890125},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a626e1a63cc49db6\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nSearch arxiv for papers with certain keywords in the Abstract\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a626e1a63cc49db6\">>>","url":"https://github.com/homangab/arxiv-search","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9d08e16f6d30adb0\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nYou signed in with another tab or window. You signed out in another tab or window. You switched accounts on another tab or window. | Name | Name | Last commit message | Last commit date |. | Latest commit   History2 Commits 2 Commits |. # Searching arxiv for papers based on topic and timestamp. This script is based on the Arxiv API and is a quick way to scrape arxiv for papers based on topics (like Model-based RL) and a timestamp beyond which to search. Run `python arxiv_by_topic.py  --time=` to obtain a csv file `arxiv.csv` of URLs for all papers with the specified keywords in the abstract and first upload timestamp beond the time specified. For example, to search for all papers with keywords `model` and `reinforcement` in the abstract with a first upload timestamp beyond Jan 1, 2019, use the following command `python arxiv_by_topic.py model reinforcement --time='2019-01-01'`. Search arxiv for papers with certain keywords in the Abstract.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9d08e16f6d30adb0\">>>","score":0.99877447},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0c5aba289ce01e84\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nSearch for articles - arXiv info\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"0c5aba289ce01e84\">>>","url":"https://info.arxiv.org/help/find.html","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"35048414f031a007\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWe gratefully acknowledge support from the Simons Foundation, member institutions, and all contributors. + If you know the identifier. # Finding Articles. ## Search. Enter a few title words and/or author names and/or abstract words into the \"**Search or Article-id**\" box in the top right of most pages (including this one) or you can use the Advanced Search. ## If you know the identifier. All arXiv submissions are assigned a unique identifier of the form `yymm.nnnnn` (or `arch-ive/yymmnnn` for older submissions). To retrieve the abstract page a paper simply enter the identifier in the \"**Search or Article-id**\" box in the top right of most pages. You can also construct the URL (web address) for a paper with a given identifier as `http://arxiv.org/abs/`. http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9603067 http://arxiv.org/abs/0705.0123. From the abstract page you will be able to choose your preferred format for downloading and viewing the paper. Get status notifications via email or slack.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"35048414f031a007\">>>","score":0.9979966}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774747835151}}
{"type":"message","id":"0c4b0e6d","parentId":"f514d09a","timestamp":"2026-03-29T01:30:52.028Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have enough information to give a comprehensive answer about searching preprint websites. Let me summarize the main points:\n\n1. **arXiv** (https://arxiv.org) - the biggest preprint server for physics, math, CS, etc.\n2. **bioRxiv** (https://www.bioRxiv.org) - for biology and life sciences\n3. **medRxiv** (https://www.medRxiv.org) - for medicine\n4. **CNXIV** (cnxiv.org) - Chinese preprint platform\n5. **SSRN** - social sciences\n6. **PsyArXiv** - psychology\n\n\n7. **Search strategies** - I can use basic keyword searches on titles and abstracts, apply Boolean operators for more precision, filter by subject categories and date ranges, or leverage the API for automated searches across multiple platforms.","thinkingSignature":"c67c9aa5711fcc94a324d5df55371cf0cd88f43e8b17c94daa73c79084d3f71f"},{"type":"text","text":"整理一下主流预印本网站的搜索方法：\n\n---\n\n## 📚 主要预印本平台\n\n| 平台 | 网址 | 覆盖领域 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| **arXiv** | arxiv.org | 物理、数学、计算机科学等 |\n| **bioRxiv** | biorxiv.org | 生物、生命科学 |\n| **medRxiv** | medrxiv.org | 医学 |\n| **CNXIV** | cnxiv.org | 中立，覆盖全学科 |\n| **SSRN** | ssrn.com | 社会科学、经济学 |\n| **PsyArXiv** | psyarxiv.com | 心理学 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 搜索技巧\n\n### arXiv（最常用）\n\n**基础搜索：**\n直接在首页搜索框输入关键词，会搜标题、作者、摘要。\n\n**高级搜索：**\n👉 https://arxiv.org/search/advanced\n\n可以精确控制：\n- 搜索范围：标题 / 摘要 / 作者 / 全文\n- 按学科分类筛选（如 `cs.AI`、`math.CO`、`physics.gen-ph`）\n- 按日期范围筛选（提交日期或公布日期）\n- 支持布尔运算符：`AND`、`OR`、`ANDNOT`\n\n**搜索语法示例：**\n```\n# 搜索标题含关键词\nti:\"machine learning\"\n\n# 搜索摘要含多个词\nabs:transformer AND abs:image\n\n# 日期过滤\nsubmittedDate:[20230101 TO 20231231]\n\n# 组合\nabs:diffusion model AND cat:cs.LG AND submittedDate:[2024 TO 2025]\n```\n\n### bioRxiv / medRxiv\n\n直接访问主页，搜索框支持关键词搜索，也可以按主题领域（Subject Areas）、日期排序。\n\n### crossref / Google Scholar\n\n也可以用 **Google Scholar**（scholar.google.com）搜索，勾选\"包含预印本\"选项，结果会混入 arXiv 等来源。\n\n### 编程方式（批量获取）\n\narXiv 提供 API：\n```\nhttps://export.arxiv.org/api/query?search_query=all:machine+learning&start=0&max_results=10\n```\n支持按 `all`/`ti`/`au`/`abs` 搜索。\n\n---\n\n## 💡 建议流程\n\n1. 先去 **arXiv 高级搜索** 确定主题 + 学科范围\n2. 用日期过滤只看近年的\n3. 有编程需求再用 API 批量拉\n\n需要帮你搜什么具体主题吗？可以把关键词告诉我，我帮你构造搜索语法或者直接调 API 查。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":6878,"output":693,"cacheRead":36393,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43964,"cost":{"input":0.0020634,"output":0.0008315999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0021835799999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005078579999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774747835158,"responseId":"0617b3bb3c6dd0af3d3b7946438d0700"}}
